    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiete</strong> is a hardcore open-world survival action RPG set during the <strong>Eon of the Forbidden Chant</strong>, when a calamity rendered the spoken word unusable. In this world, <strong>silence means survival</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, fight, loot, and survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I</strong>mmerse in a land torn apart by conflict and mistery. Face deadly factions, uncover lost knowledge, and carve out your place. Ruthless warbands, enigmatic cults, and desperate survivors all fight for dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle and every discovery brings new risks and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521570/extras/50ec6268d93501f2ec9dc2df2f7cf521.avif?t=1740171503\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather and return stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources, artifacts, and knowledge will be vital for your survival. Every item, every silent interaction, and every battle will shape your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, unearth forgotten relics, and seek hidden truths to gain an edge in a world that offers no mercy.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521570/extras/bdf761f36ae462f95ce26d85a2828a2e.avif?t=1740171503\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Research</strong> and acquire knowledge to upgrade your loadouts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft better weapons, enhance your gear, and return to the fight better equipped for the dangers ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt, experiment, and forge the tools you need to overcome stronger foes and harsher challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521570/extras/098bdf0e99da9406a398d2ee3a85fdbc.avif?t=1740171503\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive alone or with allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to share resources, plan silent strategies, and fight for survival together. In a world where words bring death, coordination and trust will determine who thrives and who fades into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521570/extras/82d6dea9befca0c037c049b257b55a91.avif?t=1740171503\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quiete</strong> is a hardcore open-world survival action RPG set during the <strong>Eon of the Forbidden Chant</strong>, when a calamity rendered the spoken word unusable. In this world, <strong>silence means survival</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, fight, loot, and survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I</strong>mmerse in a land torn apart by conflict and mistery. Face deadly factions, uncover lost knowledge, and carve out your place. Ruthless warbands, enigmatic cults, and desperate survivors all fight for dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle and every discovery brings new risks and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521570/extras/50ec6268d93501f2ec9dc2df2f7cf521.avif?t=1740171503\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather and return stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources, artifacts, and knowledge will be vital for your survival. Every item, every silent interaction, and every battle will shape your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, unearth forgotten relics, and seek hidden truths to gain an edge in a world that offers no mercy.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521570/extras/bdf761f36ae462f95ce26d85a2828a2e.avif?t=1740171503\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Research</strong> and acquire knowledge to upgrade your loadouts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft better weapons, enhance your gear, and return to the fight better equipped for the dangers ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt, experiment, and forge the tools you need to overcome stronger foes and harsher challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521570/extras/098bdf0e99da9406a398d2ee3a85fdbc.avif?t=1740171503\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive alone or with allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to share resources, plan silent strategies, and fight for survival together. In a world where words bring death, coordination and trust will determine who thrives and who fades into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521570/extras/82d6dea9befca0c037c049b257b55a91.avif?t=1740171503\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p>",
